"""
Road slope as a function of world position and heading: x and y in meters and heading in
radians to tan of the road angle along that heading, positive uphill.

`VehicleComponents.Road.slope(file)` builds one from an OpenCRG height file; a component that
needs the grade takes it as a `structural parameter` of this type and calls it on its own pose.
"""
type Slope = func(::Real, ::Real, ::Real)::Real
